                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "f4f777af-6d5c-4896-8fc7-341648d67459",
                                "sense_id": "150fde58-0bf2-359a-8016-59fb8bb93116",
                                "text": "Дрова́ уже́ и тогда́ в Орле́ бы́ли о́чень до́роги, и бе́дные лю́ди ота́пливались то гре́чневою лузго́ю, то наво́зом, а после́днее тре́бовало большо́й загото́вки.",
                                "translation": "Firewood in Orel was already very expensive even then, and poor people heated either with buckwheat chaff or with dung, and the latter required big provisions.",
                                "english": "Firewood in Orel was already very expensive even then, and poor people heated either with buckwheat chaff or with dung, and the latter required big provisions."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
